'''Tenzing''' is a {{wp|Sherpa people|sherpa}} living in the house just west of [[Burthorpe]]. The player needs to go through his house to take the secret path past [[Death Plateau (location)|Death Plateau]] on the way to [[Trollheim]].

He is involved in the [[Death Plateau]] and [[Troll Romance]] quests. He sells [[climbing boots]] for 12 coins each.

To get to him, follow the path north of the [[Warriors' Guild]] then go west once there's a fork in the path. Continue up to reach the house. Open the gate, knock on the door and talk to him (you must have completed Death Plateau to equip these boots).

If you try to open the door before learning of the secret path, he will shoo the player away saying "No milk today! Thank you!"

