==Trivia==
*In the original version of [[Death Plateau]] featured in the ''RuneScape 2'' beta files, Tenzing was known as [[Sherpa (RuneScape 2 Beta)|Sherpa]].
*Tenzing has a pet goat named [[Billy]].
*{{wp|Tenzing Norgay}} was a Sherpa and guide to {{wp|Sir Edmund Hillary}} who together became the first men to summit Mount Everest on 29 May 1953.

